/**
 * @file The deduction of SymPy's assumption facts (`StdFactKB`): from the
 * assumptions given to a symbol, every fact they imply (`positive=True`
 * gives `real`, `nonzero`, `finite`, `commutative`, ...), with SymPy's
 * compiled rule tables (the implications of each fact and the rules whose
 * conditions together imply one more).
 */

